# frame came off the shelf and became quoted custom work (Jeff's call: they
# need too much per-piece adjustment to carry a fixed price). Their product
# pages are retired.
#
# These send anyone holding an old link to the custom-work page, which is
# where all ten of their photographs now live, instead of a 404. 301 because
